			"notes": "# Tinkers' Compatibility 2.1.0 Snapshot 29/07/26\n\n## Additions:\n- Added flavour text for all materials.\n- Added melting recipes for Ad Astra plates.\n- Added translations for Alternative Vines & Dragonscale tags.\n- Craftable modifiers are now tagged properly.\n- Ad Astra ores now have proper ore melting recipes.\n- Desh now has the new \"Discharge\" trait.\n- Ostrum now has the new \"Cryogenic\" trait.\n- Added an optional built-in resource pack with sprites for extra addon integration.\n- Added the Dart Shooter as a modifiable tool.\n- Added unique parts for Dart Shooters.\n- Added integration with Create:\n  - Materials:\n    - Brass (Clockwork Trait)\n  - Modifiers:\n    - Wrenching (Harvest primary)\n    - Goggles (Helmets)\n  - Recipes:\n    - All metal blocks and items can now be melted in the smeltery.\n    - Chocolate Bars can now be melted in the smeltery.\n- Added the following vine materials/variants:\n  - Betternether:\n    - Black Vine | Variant of Weeping Vine\n    - Golden Vine\n    - Blooming Vine\n  - Betterend:\n    - Twisted Vine | Variant of Twisting Vine\n    - Jungle Vine | Variant of Twisting Vine\n    - Bulb Vine\n    - Dense Vine\n  - Biomes We've Gone:\n    - Skyris Vine | Variant of Vine\n  - Aether Redux:\n    - Corrupted Vine\n    - Golden Vine\n  - Deep Aether\n    - Yagroot Vine\n  - Deeper & Darker\n    - Sculk Vine\n- \"regions_unexplored:kapok_vines\" & \"biomesoplenty:willow_vine\" can be used to craft normal vine parts.\n\n## Changes:\n- EMI is no longer compiled as it is only needed during runtime testing.\n- Blighted now works for melee and thorns damage.\n- \"blightbunny_fang\" & \"mykapod_shell\" now have the correct load conditions.\n- Tweaked Glaive stats:\n  - Base Attack Speed: 1.0 -> 1.1\n  - Durability Multiplier: 1.5 -> 1.2\n  - Melee Sweep Range: 3.0 -> 4.0\n  - Attack Damage Multiplier: 1.5 -> 0\n- Un-Deprecated Zanite & Skyjade materials.\n- Nether Ruby now uses the proper gem material recipe method.\n- Storage blocks for the niche Malum materials can now be used to craft parts.\n- Gravitite now supports Bow Limbs & Bow Grips.\n- Ascension now floats entities struck by a projectile.\n- Pyral ranged parts should now be obtainable."
		},
